; RT27 / PT27 (#945), ADR 0056.1. AutoCAD 2021: VISTA is at 0,0,
; NASCOSTO at 2,2 and VISIBILE at 2,6 (DXF handles 95, 97 and 98).
; A 10-pixel aperture at 0.1 units/pixel isolates each attribute.
; Text boxes use Liberation Sans Regular, cap height 1409, ascent 1854,
; descent -434 and the summed hmtx advances (no kerning).
OPEN
; cambia con #945
@sources/autocad-attdisp-off
!view 0,0 0.1 800x600
!osnap ins
LINE
!move 2,2
!report
!move 2,6
!report
!esc
